€In the tradition of David Macaulay's The Way Things Work, this popular-science book--a unique collaboration between a world-renowned molecular biologist and an equally talented artist--explains how life grows, develops, reproduces, and gets by. Full color."	
›	O Imre Kertes, o opoios den eikhe kamia prothese na grapsei ten autobiographia tou, plekei aristotekhnika to diplo mito autou tou bibliou: ten amphidrome skhese metaxu muthoplasias kai pragmatikotetas, metaxu biomatikes empeirias kai kallitekhnikes demiourgias, kathos kai metaxu aisthetikes kai aphegematikes dunatotetas. O Phakelos K. apotelei eisagoge alla kai epitome tou ergou tou, katadeiknuontas te semasia tes graphes sten polukumante zoe tou nompelista suggraphea.
To biblio touto gennetheke anorthodoxa. O Kertes edose sunenteuxe ston philo kai epimelete ton biblion tou Zoltan Khaphner. Otan omos diabase tis protes grammes tou apomagnetophonemenou keimenou, anoixe ton upologiste kai egrapse ena biblio dinontas sunenteuxe ston eauto tou. To alter ego tou rotaei kai o idios apantaei. Einai loipon autobiographia; "Okhi", apanta o Kertes, pou aphieronei arketes selides gia na exegesei te diaphora metaxu biographias kai muthoplasias. Se kathe periptose, briskomaste mprosta se ena uperokho keimeno, enos sophou anthropou. Pou te sophia tou den te metatrepei se apostase apo tous allous, antitheta, te phernei dipla tous.
(M. Pimples, Ta Nea, Bibliodromio, 12/5/2007)"µ
²"Otan epistrepsame ston purgo, eidame kamposous axiomatikous pou trigurizan kordotoi, san paraxena pagonia.
Tous parakolouthousame apo to parko, krummenoi piso apo mia oxia kai mia marmarine thea. Etan ena metaxenio apogeuma, konta sto lukophos. 'Ekhoume aphesei tipota ekei apenanti;' rotesa.
'Ta mela sta dentra, ton aera, ton khrusaphenio Oktobre kai ta oneira mas', apokritheke e 'Elen.
'Auta ta aphenoume panta piso mas', tes apantesa. 'San istous arakhnes pou tous parasernei o anemos to phthinoporo'..."
Lisabona, ste dine tou Deuterou Pagkosmiou Polemou. Enas antras periergazetai me deos to bapori pou anakhorei ten epomene gia ten Amerike, ten Kiboto tou Noe pou tha sosei ekatontades prosphuges san ki auton apo ton bibliko kataklusmo tou nazismou. Mes sto skotadi, enas anthropos-skia ton plesiazei gia na tou proteinei mia paraxene sumphonia: ekeinos tha tou dosei ta eisiteria pou oneireuetai, exasphalizontas tou mia these sto monadiko meson diaphuges apo to kamini tes sparassomenes Europes, arkei... Arkei o allos na tou kharisei mia nukhta, na thelesei n' akousei ten istoria tou: mia phora ki enan kairo, enas antras kai mia gunaika pou agapiontousan polu prospathesan na drapeteusoun apo ton polemo kai ton thanato. Oi dioktes tous tous peran sto katopi, epaixan mazi tous opos e gata me to pontiki kai sto telos, tous epiasan! Ena muthistorema me eroa ton anthropo kai to monadiko oplo pou tou dotheke gia na nikesei te phrike: te mneme!"¶
³Me posous tropous mporei na perigraphei ena asemanto epeisodio, ap auta pou sumbainoun guro mas, sten kathemerine mas zoe; Me 99 apanta o Raiemon Keno kai idou e apodeixe:
Oi ASKESEIS UPhOUS, ena apo ta pio diaskedastika kai, sigoura, to pio prototupo biblio sten Istoria tes Pagkosmias Logotekhnias. Se kapoio Parisino leophoreio, mian ora aikhmes, enas antipathetikos nearos xekinaei ena kabga me to diplano tou <>. M ena anexantleto kataigismo apolaustikon eurematon, o Keno, enas apo tous pio pneumatodeis suggrapheis tou aiona mas, parousiazei 99 parallages tou epeisodiou, ap tis opoies semeionoume endeiktika: ten parallage se Theatriko, kai se Dekapentasullabo, te Philosophike, te Magkike, ten Osphretike, ten Kruptographike, te Semeiologike, te Botanike, te Geometrike, te Khoriatike kai ten (entelos) Anapantekhe, me ten opoia kleinei auto to xekardistiko biblio ton ekplexeon.
